SUMMARY:An Evening with Underground Springhouse
DESCRIPTION:Thursday\, May 7  •  9 PM – 12 AM | From $12 adv. Event Details and Tickets \n“More of the good\, less of the bad.” That’s the motto upon which Underground Springhouse have built their sound and style. Exploring southern rock\, indie\, and reggae influences within a rock ‘n roll context\, Springhouse has crafted a genre-bending catalog that takes listeners from beaches to back roads with ear-worm hooks and head-bobbing grooves. \nSince releasing their debut\, self-titled album\, “Underground Springhouse” (2021)\, the band has played over 100 shows each year. Through this relentless touring\, Springhouse’s members have honed their musical craft alongside one another\, maturing into the kind of cohesive\, distinctive group that forms when bandmates spend countless hours on stage together. undergroundspringhouse.com \n  \nWith two unique locations\, built inside buildings that were previously cast aside\, One World brews with the intention of fostering nourishing interaction and artistic cultural experiences. From live music to art shows\, “One World Brewing” is born from the magic that happens when the whole becomes greater than the sum of its parts. Our taprooms are intersections for people of all walks of life and different corners of the globe\, enjoying this time and place together.  Check out our upcoming schedule: click here
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/underground-springhouse/
LOCATION:One World Brewing – West\, 520 Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, North Carolina\, 28806
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Screenshot-2026-05-06-203042-e1778113911322.png
GEO:35.5783642;-82.5848526
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=One World Brewing – West 520 Haywood Rd Asheville North Carolina 28806;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=520 Haywood Rd:geo:-82.5848526,35.5783642
END:VEVENT
