SUMMARY:NEARBY & NOTABLE | Steve Sutton Fest 2026
DESCRIPTION:Steve Sutton Fest returns to Haywood County May 8 and 9\, 2026 – at the beautiful Lake Junaluska Stuart Auditorium! This is a nonprofit event with all proceeds going back into music programs in Haywood County.\n\nEach day $30 advance ticket/$40 at gate Event Details and Tickets\n\nSTEVE SUTTON was a Western North Carolina musician who spent his whole life entertaining audiences\, sharing joy and helping others. The Steve Sutton Festival and The Steve Sutton Memorial Charitable Trust (501(c)(3)) were created to continue that legacy.\n\nThis year’s lineup for Steve Sutton Fest features a great variety of roots music traditions!
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/nearby-notable-steve-sutton-fest-2026/2026-05-08/
LOCATION:Lake Junaluska Stuart Auditorium\, 91 N Lakeshore Dr\, Lake Junaluska\,\, NC\, 28745\, United States
CATEGORIES:Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/686844152_934160109589075_588896851652268304_n-e1777648479271.jpg
