SUMMARY:BoogiTherapi | Fridays In The RAD Music Series
DESCRIPTION:Join us this Friday May 8 for the funky soulful sounds of BoogiTherapi. Come celebrate the beginning of the weekend with great sounds\, refreshing beverages and great tacos! Show starts at 6pm and is free for everyone!\n\n\n\n\nRecords in the RAD in the River Arts District is a thoughtfully curated record store with an eclectic selection of vinyl\, both new and used. In addition to records\, we also have a music inspired art gallery\, which features artwork from Brian\, Dylan and Susan Haynes. recordsintherad.com \nAt Wedge Brewing\, we got our start in the River Arts District\, and therefore hold art and community very close to us. We create beer for the creatives and give them a place to commune. wedgebrewing.com \n  \nScreenshot\n  \n  \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/los-gun-show-fridays-in-the-rad-music-series/
LOCATION:Records in the RAD/The Wedge
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
